                    {
                        "form_id": "74006e1f-9a17-48a3-90e6-5cbc26c9af95",
                        "entry_id": "e31af703-b032-3358-a29e-d75d1cba0811",
                        "tags": [
                            "diminutive",
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "rariteitjes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ebd69704-c404-3ac6-b04d-609e2e719f00",
                        "entry_id": "e31af703-b032-3358-a29e-d75d1cba0811",
                        "glosses": [
                            "van een voorwerp dat het bijzonder en zeldzaam is, maar geen kunstzinnige of wetenschappelijke waarde heeft"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fbc2ff98-740f-46b2-9c0d-8010f0e59261",
                                "sense_id": "ebd69704-c404-3ac6-b04d-609e2e719f00",
                                "text": "Een podiumbeest als Grace ­Jones verdient een band die meer risico’s durft te nemen. Ze verdient een show die haar talenten écht in de verf zet en het freak­showgehalte overstijgt. Want voor een bijna zeventigjarige heeft ­Jones een droom van een strak lijf; ze kronkelde als een slang over het podium en stond negen minuten aan een stuk te hoelahoepen. En ze liet horen dat haar stem nog evenveel kracht heeft als in 1981. Toch hadden we het gevoel dat we naar een rariteit zaten te kijken, en niet naar een waardig ouder wordende superster."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7d5b8635-950f-4f2b-869d-e723c5bd3ff6",
                                "sense_id": "ebd69704-c404-3ac6-b04d-609e2e719f00",
                                "text": "Hoewel veel festivalgangers er al een heftige feestavond op hebben zitten, staan ze vandaag weer klaar voor de eerste volle festivaldag van de Zwarte Cross. Onze razende reporter Robbert Boeijink doet live verslag van de optredens, stunts en andere rariteiten op het terrein. Wie (en wat) zal hij allemaal tegenkomen?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "69caced2-c057-4208-a195-1fb7002c6c30",
                        "source_entry_id": "e31af703-b032-3358-a29e-d75d1cba0811",
                        "source_sense_id": "ebd69704-c404-3ac6-b04d-609e2e719f00",
                        "source_sense_description": "van een voorwerp dat het bijzonder en zeldzaam is, maar geen kunstzinnige of wetenschappelijke waarde heeft",
                        "target_lang_word": "curiosity",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "curiosity",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f477fb40-1a8b-3b00-890a-9460c1f359a9",
                                        "entry_id": "e3e55dc4-96c6-33ac-909a-c800b1e5e478",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Inquisitiveness; the tendency to ask and learn about things by asking questions, investigating, or exploring."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c1026706-1c29-45b0-b235-122fba442fe8",
                                                "sense_id": "f477fb40-1a8b-3b00-890a-9460c1f359a9",
                                                "text": "It was the first time that the lawyer had been received in that part of his friend's quarters; and he eyed the dingy, windowless structure with curiosity, and gazed round with a distasteful sense of strangeness as he crossed the theatre"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e748b5f-def5-455b-a2d8-76b8655ff1ae",
                                                "sense_id": "f477fb40-1a8b-3b00-890a-9460c1f359a9",
                                                "text": "\"Certainly there is nothing wrong with Alvin's intelligence, but many of the things that should concern him seem to be a matter of complete indifference. On the other hand, he shows a morbid curiosity regarding subjects which we do not generally discuss.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b86655c1-bd86-4b45-b960-05e313eb361a",
                                                "sense_id": "f477fb40-1a8b-3b00-890a-9460c1f359a9",
                                                "text": "Curiosity about the power of self-control skills, which include conscientiousness, self-discipline, and perseverance, arose from recent empirical observations that preschool Head Start, an ambitious, federally funded program of special services launched in 1965 to boost the intellectual development of needy children, has failed to achieve the goal of boosting IQ scores. But the programs have unexpectedly succeeded in lowering the former pupils’ rates of teen pregnancy, school dropout, delinquency, and work absenteeism."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5406f22d-aa04-3aea-95fd-d651c3cc85c7",
                                        "entry_id": "e3e55dc4-96c6-33ac-909a-c800b1e5e478",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A unique or extraordinary object which arouses interest."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d81882a-884f-4f5e-ac47-453884524121",
                                                "sense_id": "5406f22d-aa04-3aea-95fd-d651c3cc85c7",
                                                "text": "He put the strangely shaped rock in his curiosity cabinet."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6be38f10-463d-459b-b277-26a69e9ef53e",
                                                "sense_id": "5406f22d-aa04-3aea-95fd-d651c3cc85c7",
                                                "text": "[The room] was adorned with a great number of nicknacks and curiosities, which might have engaged the attention of a virtuoso."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d4ae9317-17b3-4139-b0a3-ca6a84241f9b",
                                                "sense_id": "5406f22d-aa04-3aea-95fd-d651c3cc85c7",
                                                "text": "The loss of his tye-periwig and laced hat, which were curiosities of the kind, did not at all contribute to the improvement of the picture […]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5a273c3e-4d9f-349f-aa12-c7eb0d99af44",
                                        "entry_id": "e3e55dc4-96c6-33ac-909a-c800b1e5e478",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Careful, delicate construction; fine workmanship, delicacy of building."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b3c8cfe8-8db4-4f96-9ce9-ac3549b78beb",
                                                "sense_id": "5a273c3e-4d9f-349f-aa12-c7eb0d99af44",
                                                "text": "wee built a homely thing like a barne, set upon Cratchets, covered with rafts, sedge, and earth, so also was the walls; the best of our houses of the like curiosity, but the most part farre much worse workmanship […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
